# Keep the working tree identical on native Linux and Windows/WSL (see docs/development_environment.md).

# Text files: LF everywhere, also when checked out with Git for Windows (core.autocrlf).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Raw research data is verified byte-for-byte by checksum manifests (data/processed/*sha256.json): never convert.
data/raw/** -text

# Python's csv module writes CRLF line endings (RFC 4180); keep CSVs exactly as written.
*.csv -text

*.jpg binary
*.png binary
